The Military-Industrial Complex — Exploded Teardown short (1080×1920, 75 s)

Made in code: no AI-generated video, no stock footage. The jet, buildings, bombers, satellites and drones are a schematic model built in three.js (generic, not to scale; no logos, no national or company insignia).
